- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features --locked -- -D warnings` passed.
- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` and `git diff --check` passed.
- `mvn -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml verify` passed: 37 manifest scenarios, 79 Java-decoded Rust typed headers, and 15 typed bodies.
